# Bot2 responds to the -4 by killing its own Woodland Changeling (the creature target) with Lightning Bolt: the ability still resolves
# for the target still legal (CR 608.2b), so Bot2 is dealt 2 (20 -> 18) while nothing else is dealt damage by it. Bot1's Jace token goes to 1.

